---
title: Checkout · chọn phương thức thanh toán
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant A0 as Browser / modal
    participant A1 as CheckoutCheckout
    participant A2 as Extension model
    participant A3 as Payment model
    participant A4 as PaymentGateway
    A0->>A1: AJAX checkout/checkout + extension_id
    A1->>A1: isLogged / member_token gate
    A1->>A2: getExtension(extension_id)
    A1->>A3: getPayments(member_id)
    A1->>A4: isStripeEnabled / isBraintreeEnabled / isPayPalEnabled
    A1->>A0: view checkout/checkout → modal HTML
